 This has made Kenneth a truly beloved DJ and musician, who likes to stand out of the crowd, a man with a vivid imagination and a leader of a whole generation of dancers and music lovers. Bager is a musical tastemaker and a cultural trendsetter and therefore has the magnificent skill to spot talented artists and carefully handpick releases to [l=Music For Dreams].\r\nThe corner stone of [l=Music For Dreams] is the globally appealing sound and encompassing range of genres spanning from danceable balearic and electronic to beautiful ambient music.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:18929","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":[{"id":381070,"name":"Luftkastellet"},{"id":1520528,"name":"Music For Clubs"},{"id":50636,"name":"Music For Dreams America"},{"id":63407,"name":"Shhh!records"},{"id":1426008,"name":"The Serious Collector Series"}]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/18929-Music-For-Dreams","type":"label","urls":["http://www.musicfordreams.dk","http://musicfordreams.bandcamp.com","http://www.facebook.com/musicfordreams","http://www.myspace.com/musicfordreams","http://soundcloud.com/music-for-dreams","http://twitter.com/musicfordreams","http://www.youtube.com/user/musicfordreams"]}},"/api/discogs/release/10241165":{"cached":true,"release":{"artists":[{"id":null,"name":"Fiona Apple"}],"formats":[],"genres":["Rock","Pop"],"id":"10241165","images":[],"labels":[{"catno":"88985420001","id":1005,"name":"Epic"},{"catno":"88985420001","id":131935,"name":"Clean Slate"},{"catno":"88985420001","id":276086,"name":"Sony Music Commercial Music Group"}],"styles":["Pop Rock"],"title":"Tidal","tracklist":["Sleep To Dream","Sullen Girl","Shadowboxer","Criminal","Slow Like Honey","The First Taste","Never Is A Promise","The Child Is Gone","Pale September","Carrion"],"uri":"https://www.discogs.com/release/10241165","videos":[],"year":2017}},"/api/discogs/release/12487397/credits":{"cached":true,"credits":[{"id":17217,"name":"Shinichi Atobe","role